==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Krabby}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Crystal Guardians|Krabby|54}} from the {{TCG|EX Crystal Guardians}} expansion.
*{{m|Vise Grip}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Krabby}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

